    "text": "I, hereby give Notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, No. 28 of 1964, (Amendment) that the Government intends to acquire. The following Land which is required for the 5th (Volunteer) Sri Lanka Singha Regiment. Description of the land to be acquired:",
